coords = (uint, uint)
; A `.cbor` payload wrapping an anonymous array-of-plain-group (`bytes .cbor [coords]`): the plain
; group `coords` must be promoted to an Array-rep Record struct and emitted, not dangled on a bare,
; never-emitted `Coords`.
wrapped = bytes .cbor [coords]
; The same array-of-plain-group directly in member position (`[coords]` as a field type) exercises
; the identical promotion path (formerly it too dangled).
holder = [c: [coords]]
